<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Interactive portfolio report with performance charts, tax overview, and FIRE projections — powered by WealthEagle.">
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
<meta property="og:title" content="Portfolio Report — WealthEagle">
